  "summary": "Watercolours: Basics & Beyond",
  "description": "Register Here Starting August 11! Registration for all Aurora Cultural Centre programs is on the Town of Aurora’s e-PLAY website. All programs continue to be part of the Aurora Cultural Centre. September 18 – November 6, 2025 Thursdays | 6:30 – 9:00 pm | Ages 16+ Aurora Town Square – Shining Hill Visual Arts Studio A 50 Victoria Street, Aurora This beginner class will introduce the beautiful and timeless medium of watercolours. You will build skills each week, with demonstrations, exercises, encouragement and plenty of time to paint in class. Please note the required Materials List below Materials List",
